The file was being cut off mid-comment at line 3859 ('canvas, packs t'),
which caused 'SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token' on imgready.app
and prevented the main tool from loading. Restored the missing tail
(processIco function, end of script, closing tags) from the working
1b4f9c1c Cloudflare worker preview.
